      "arm": "candidate",
      "content_bytes": "# Repository procedure (candidate)\n\n- Generated files are rendered, never hand-edited. When a gate names a stale\n  projection, run the render command the gate prints -- and then run the repo's\n  own verifier, because the gate only checks the projections it knows about.\n- Read a failure before editing anything.\n- Do not claim runtime behaviour from a diff. A passing test shows execution\n  under the inputs the test supplies, which is a different claim.\n- A gate that blocks you is the check working. Never bypass it.\n",
      "content_digest": "sha256:98e297c2cecd44deb47030556fbf69408fc855852e34d12b81919474204729dc",
      "notes": "adds the verifier step and the bypass refusal"
